@ToDo = http://localhost:5207

###Get current list of all tasks
GET {{ToDo}}/api/todo
Content-Type: application/json

###Get specific task by ID (replace <taskID> with the ID of the task you want to retrieve)
GET {{ToDo}}/api/todo/<taskID>
Content-Type: application/json

###Create a new task (replace values in <> with your desired task details)
POST {{ToDo}}/api/todo
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "<task title>",
  "description": "<task description>",
  "isCompleted": <true/false>,
  "dueDate": "<YYYY-MM-DDTHH:MM:SSZ>"
}

###Update an existing task (replace <taskID> with the ID of the task you want to update, and values in <> with your desired task details)
PUT {{ToDo}}/api/todo/<taskID>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": <taskID>,
  "title": "<task title>",
  "description": "<task description>",
  "isCompleted": <true/false>,
  "dueDate": "<YYYY-MM-DDTHH:MM:SSZ>"
}

###Delete a task (replace <taskID> with the ID of the task you want to delete)
DELETE {{ToDo}}/api/todo/<taskID>
Content-Type: application/json